# Search

Table search does not fire on every character. The field shows the draft at once. The page address and the request receive the latest value, but not more often than once per `FIND_WAIT_MS`. The number is one, next to the search. A choice filter waits zero and fires at once.

While search or a filter has not yet reached a table already on screen, that table has a loader and a dim. The rule is in `table-load.mdc`. The search field and the header are not dimmed. An empty response and an error stay as text. A timed journal refresh does not turn the loader on.

```tsx
const [draft, setDraft, applied, held] = useField(QUERY);
<HoldRegion held={held}>{rows}</HoldRegion>
```
